;"><img border="0" width="48" height="48" id="_x0000_i1058" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/icon-points.png" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6A130"></span><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF7F50" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><o:p data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF81B0"></o:p></span></font></p></td><td width="523" colspan="2" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF8410" style="width: 392.45pt; padding: 2.85pt 0mm;"><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF8540" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF7110"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF7370" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">More Qantas Points</span></strong><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF75D0" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D69310">As a Qantas Business Rewards member you can earn Qantas Points* for your business on top of the points and Status Credits you and your employees earn as a Frequent Flyer.</span><sup data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF7960"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF7A90" style="font-size: 7pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">#<o:p data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF7700"></o:p></span></sup></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF6400" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF6660" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></p></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF69F0"><td width="76" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF6D80" style="width: 56.75pt; padding: 2.85pt 0mm;"><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF41B0" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF4410" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></p></td><td width="48" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF47A0" style="width: 35.85pt; padding: 2.85pt 0mm;"><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF5F40" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF5970"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF5AA0" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" id="_x0000_i1053" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/lightbulb-icon-small.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFFE80" style="border-style: none; display: block; height: 30px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;"><o:p data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF5250"></o:p></font></span></strong></p></td><td width="475" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF5380" style="width: 356.6pt; padding: 2.85pt 0mm;"><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF4A00" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><i data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF4B30"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEE790" style="font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Just ensure you and your team&nbsp;<b data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEE9F0">include your business's ABN and Qantas Frequent Flyer number in the booking so you never miss a point.<o:p data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEEC50"></o:p></b></font></span></i></p><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEEEB0" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEF110"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEF370" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEF830" style="height: 23.15pt;"><td width="76" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF07A0" style="width: 56.75pt; padding: 2.85pt 0mm; height: 23.15pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF0A00" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF0C60" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><img border="0" width="48" height="48" id="_x0000_i1057" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/qbr-icon-business-account-48x48.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C01C2D0"></span><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF0EC0" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><o:p data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF1120"></o:p></span></font></p></td><td width="523" colspan="2" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF1380" style="width: 392.45pt; padding: 2.85pt 0mm; height: 23.15pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF15E0" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF1970"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF1BB0" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Trips</span></strong><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF1710" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C01B120">Discover a seamless booking experience with the ability to easily book and manage your business' flights, hotels and car hire all in one place. Enjoy the flexibility to book each component separately or as one comprehensive trip.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C018C70"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C012080">By adding your flights, hotels and car hire to a trip, you can see all your business travel in a single view.<o:p data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF1840"></o:p></span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEFA90" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><i data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEFCF0"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEFF50" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></i></p></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CF0410" style="height: 23.15pt;"><td width="76" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002077DFA0" style="width: 56.75pt; padding: 2.85pt 0mm; height: 23.15pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002077E200" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEE070" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></p></td><td width="48" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEE2D0" style="width: 35.85pt; padding: 2.85pt 0mm; height: 23.15pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0123F0" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C012650"><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0128B0" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" id="_x0000_i1054" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/lightbulb-icon-small.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFFE80" style="border-style: none; display: block; height: 30px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;"><o:p data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C012B10"></o:p></font></span></strong></p></td><td width="475" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C012D70" style="width: 356.6pt; padding: 2.85pt 0mm; height: 23.15pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CECD70" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><em data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CECFD0"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CED230" style="font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">All bookings need to be added to a trip to finalise the booking. Either add to an existing trip or create a new one.<o:p data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CED360"></o:p></font></span></em></p><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CED6F0" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEC060"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEC2C0" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEC650" style="height: 23.15pt;"><td width="76" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEC9E0" style="width: 56.75pt; padding: 2.85pt 0mm; height: 23.15pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C013CE0" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C013F40" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></p></td><td width="523" colspan="2" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEB960" style="width: 392.45pt; padding: 2.85pt 0mm; height: 23.15pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEBBA0" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEB260" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Discover more about how to book and manage your business trips&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/news/how-to-guides/book-and-manage-trips.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEB700" style="color: rgb(5, 99, 193);"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEAC90" style="color: rgb(212, 0, 0); border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0mm;">here</span></a>.<o:p data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D77610"></o:p></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEA7D0" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEA900"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D77740" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020CEA440" style="height: 81.95pt;"><td width="76" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D78580" style="width: 56.75pt; padding: 2.85pt 0mm; height: 81.95pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D786B0" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D77020" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><img border="0" width="48" height="48" id="_x0000_i1056" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/wallet-icon.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002077F2A0"></span><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D77150" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><o:p data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D774E0"></o:p></span></font></p></td><td width="523" colspan="2" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D760B0" style="width: 392.45pt; padding: 2.85pt 0mm; height: 81.95pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D76440" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D766A0"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D76DC0" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Travel Fund</span></b><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D76900" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002077BC70">Travel Fund is a new feature allowing you to store and combine the value from flights you need to cancel or change, in your Business Account. Use it instantly as a payment option, for anyone in your business, on any eligible flight.<o:p data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D76A30"></o:p></span></font></p></td></tr></tbody></table><div class="MsoNormal" align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D761E0" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; text-align: center; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D75AC0" style="font-size: 7pt; color: rgb(123, 123, 123);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><hr size="1" width="100%" noshade="" align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002077BA30" style="color: rgb(218, 218, 218);"></font></span></div><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D75BF0" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D75F80" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D75600" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D75860" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D75010" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D753A0" style="font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(50, 50, 50);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">What’s next?<o:p data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D73E40"></o:p></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D73F70" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D74C80" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D747C0" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D741D0" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">To get the most value for your business as an Account Holder, check out our '<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/getting-started.html?utm_source=qbr.qantas.com&amp;utm_medium=edm&amp;utm_campaign=day1_trigger&amp;utm_content=link_getstarted_qbr" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D74300" style="color: rgb(5, 99, 193);"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D73850" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Getting Started</span></a>' page or download our '<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/info/how-to-guide.html?utm_source=eDM&amp;utm_medium=Trigger+Day1&amp;utm_campaign=ONBOARDING&amp;utm_content=eDM+trigger+Day1+primarycta&amp;utm_term=downloadourhowtoguide" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D73980" style="color: rgb(5, 99, 193);"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D73D10" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">How-to-Guide</span></a>’.<o:p data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D73000"></o:p></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D73130" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D735F0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D72B40" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D72ED0" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">If you book through a registered Travel Agent, we recommend you reach out to them to check all the business booking information is up to date.<o:p data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D72310"></o:p></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D72440" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D728E0" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D71E50" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0181C0" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">As the Account Holder</span><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6FFB0" style="font-size: 10.5pt;">,<span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D70CA0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">&nbsp;you have full permission for all functions related to the account. We recommend you review and update users and&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/news/how-to-guides/stored-travellers.html" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D70F00" style="color: rgb(5, 99, 193);"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D713C0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">stored travellers</span></a>, along with any other business information.<o:p data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D71730"></o:p></span></span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D71030" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D71160" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D70470" style="margin: 0mm 0mm 12pt; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D706D0" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">If you would like to learn more about Qantas Business Rewards, please feel free to contact our sales team 13&nbsp;10&nbsp;85, or the Qantas Business Rewards Priority line 13&nbsp;74&nbsp;78. You can also visit our&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/faqs.html" target="_blank" title="Frequently Asked Questions" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D70910" style="color: rgb(5, 99, 193);"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D705A0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0mm;">Frequently Asked Questions</span></a>&nbsp;page and view our&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/news/how-to-guides.html" target="_blank" title="How-to Guides" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6DC10" style="color: rgb(5, 99, 193);"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6E7F0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0mm;">How-To Guides</span></a>&nbsp;for further assistance.</span><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6F630" style="font-size: 10.5pt;"><o:p data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6F760"></o:p></span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6F890" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6FC20" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Kind regards,<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002077B480"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002077B240"></span><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6EA50" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Sales team<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002077B000"><b data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6EB80">Qantas Business Rewards</b></span><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6F3D0" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><o:p data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6F040"></o:p></span></font></p></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6F170" style="height: 15pt;"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6DE70" style="padding: 0mm; height: 15pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6E0D0" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6E200" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<o:p data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6E590"></o:p></font></span></p></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6B2A0" style="height: 15pt;"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6C910" style="padding: 0mm; height: 15pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6D290" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6D3C0" style="font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<o:p data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6D4F0"></o:p></font></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="MsoNormal" align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020D6D